      "title": "README",
      "format": "md",
      "primary": true,
      "excerpt": "ksamint / 查明 Overview ksamint 是面向清晰判断、信息核验与轻盈智能协作的 IP。它帮助用户把混杂信息查清、讲明、沉淀为可复用的知识与行动依据。 ksamint is an IP for clear judgment, information verification, and lightweight intelligent collaboration. It turns mixed signals into checked context, concise explanation, and reusable knowledge. Brand Role English name: ksamint Chinese name: 查明 Main language: English Role: clarity oriented inquiry and verification IP Visual Directi",
      "text": "# ksamint / 查明\n\n## Overview\n\nksamint 是面向清晰判断、信息核验与轻盈智能协作的 IP。它帮助用户把混杂信息查清、讲明、沉淀为可复用的知识与行动依据。\n\nksamint is an IP for clear judgment, information verification, and lightweight intelligent collaboration. It turns mixed signals into checked context, concise explanation, and reusable knowledge.\n\n## Brand Role\n\n- English name: ksamint\n- Chinese name: 查明\n- Main language: English\n- Role: clarity-oriented inquiry and verification IP\n\n## Visual Direction\n\nThe visual language should feel fresh, exact, and calm: mint as clarity, deep green as trust, white space as disciplined attention. Avoid noisy dashboards, heavy gradients, and decorative excess.\n\n## Agent Notes\n\nUse ksamint when the task requires checking, clarifying, comparing sources, extracting signal from noise, or turning uncertainty into a concise answer.\n"
    }
